{
  "name": "Encorp | Homework | Week 04 | HW 07 | RAG Research Assistant Ingest",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "2b0692ab-de9e-4aeb-ae32-481a931b2631",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        16
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## RAG Research Assistant - Ingest (Week 04, HW 07)\nManual run -> fetch the Wikipedia article \"Artificial intelligence\" (plain text via the MediaWiki API) -> stop if empty -> delete old chunks -> split into ~60k-char segments -> loop: chunks (2000 chars, 200 overlap) -> Gemini embeddings (3072) -> Supabase table ai_wiki_chunks -> wait 65 s.\nCovers R1. The loop and the wait keep the Gemini free-tier limits (100 requests/min, 30K tokens/min, 1000/day).",
        "color": 4,
        "width": 700,
        "height": 170
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1906f660-5012-4fe2-a6b2-c08f1d533d96",
      "name": "Group - Fetch Article",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        404,
        204
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Group - Fetch Article\nReads the article text straight from Wikipedia and prepares text, title and source. Covers R1.",
        "color": 5,
        "width": 444,
        "height": 260
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ab99a4ce-cfec-4455-a88f-3d1265b20d4b",
      "name": "Group - Chunk Embed Store",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1220,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Group - Chunk Embed Store\nDeletes old chunks of the same article, splits the text into segments, then loops: chunks (2000/200), Gemini embeddings, insert into Supabase, wait 65 s. Covers R1.",
        "color": 6,
        "width": 1240,
        "height": 580
      }
    },
